      55.05,
      452.82,
      295.13,
      510.42
    ],
    "text": "I, Wijesundara Mudiyanselage Thilakarathne Bandara Ekanayake,Acting Minister of Lands hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) ofSection 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below isneeded for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisionsof that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      524.22,
      295.1,
      605.58
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called Arachchiya Kumbura in total extent ofabout 0.5828 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 02 in Advance TracingNo.: Co/CoII/ DSO/ 98/80, prepared by the Surveyor general situatedin the Village of Welikada (within the Municipal Council limit of SriJayawardhanapura Kotte) in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division ofNugegoda in Colombo District of Western Province and bounded asfollows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
