      406.14,
      547.21,
      480.9
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 02 \u2013 Arachchiya Kumbura \u2013 Extent: About 0.5828HectareNorth: Kolonnawa canal; East: Kolonnawa canal and ArachchiyaKumbura claimed by Edwin Vithana ; South: Arachchiya Kumburaclaimed by P. A. Wilson, Dalsy Botheju and some others and Lot No.2 ; West: Arachchiya Kumbura of which the claimant could not betraced.",
